es de sa famille","en":"News of his family"},{"fr":"Un bol de riz","en":"A bowl of rice"},{"fr":"Son prix","en":"His award"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"Parce que le temps influence la croissance du riz.","en":"Because weather affects how rice grows."}}],"id":"yuanlongping","order":115,"category":"history","level":"hsk3","hanzi":"袁隆平和杂交水稻","titlePinyin":"Yuán Lóngpíng hé zájiāo shuǐdào","title":{"fr":"Yuan Longping, le père du riz hybride","en":"Yuan Longping, Father of Hybrid Rice"},"era":{"fr":"1930 – 2021","en":"1930 – 2021"},"summary":{"fr":"Pendant la grande famine, un jeune professeur voit des gens mourir de faim au bord des routes. Il cherche dans les rizières, épi par épi, une plante que tout le monde dit impossible. Son riz nourrira des centaines de millions de personnes.","en":"During the great famine a young teacher sees people dying of hunger by the roadside. He searches the paddy fields, ear by ear, for a plant everyone says cannot exist. His rice will feed hundreds of millions."},"chars":1964}